{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015WadThHDrxVJfUZpBHbw8Z","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Python 3.15.0 final release date\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"python news october 2026\",\"url\":\"https://realpython.com/python-news-october-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"python 3150rc2\",\"url\":\"https://python.org/downloads/release/python-3150rc2\"},{\"title\":\"python 3150\",\"url\":\"https://python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/\"},{\"title\":\"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme\",\"url\":\"https://peps.python.org/pep-0790/\"},{\"title\":\"python 3150rc3\",\"url\":\"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150rc3/\"},{\"title\":\"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme\",\"url\":\"https://peps.python.org/790\"},{\"title\":\"ackend engineer testing Python 3.15 compatibility, package wheels, CI pipelines, and production release readiness\",\"url\":\"https://www.refontelearning.com/blog/python-3-15-compatibility-readiness\"},{\"title\":\"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme\",\"url\":\"https://peps.python.org/0790\"},{\"title\":\"python 3150 rc2\",\"url\":\"https://blog.python.org/2026/09/python-3150-rc2/\"},{\"title\":\"Python 3.15 · Version Status\",\"url\":\"https://endoflife.ai/python/3.15\"}]\n\nThe Python 3.15.0 final release is dated **October 9, 2026**, according to the python.org release page, which describes it as the stable release. Python 3.15.0 is the newest major release of the Python programming language, with 5,643 commits from 1,012 contributors.\n\nThe date moved from the original plan. PEP 790 had set the final for October 1, 2026. The team then issued a surprise third release candidate, 3.15.0rc3, on October 2, to address last-minute lazy-import blockers, which pushed the final release back a week. The rc3 announcement scheduled 3.15.0 final for 2026-10-09.\n\nEndoflife.ai also lists October 9, 2026 as the release date, with end of support on October 31, 2031.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c044aab-651c-4ab7-8e3f-da385a2436a5","uuid":"2dec9a5f-b57b-4df0-a202-f2e85a3114ae","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:38:59.201Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Python 3.15.0 final release date","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Ed786w12d7wdVqu2fM36fZ","content":[{"title":"python news october 2026","url":"https://realpython.com/python-news-october-2026/"},{"title":"python 3150rc2","url":"https://python.org/downloads/release/python-3150rc2"},{"title":"python 3150","url":"https://python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/"},{"title":"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme","url":"https://peps.python.org/pep-0790/"},{"title":"python 3150rc3","url":"https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150rc3/"},{"title":"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme","url":"https://peps.python.org/790"},{"title":"ackend engineer testing Python 3.15 compatibility, package wheels, CI pipelines, and production release readiness","url":"https://www.refontelearning.com/blog/python-3-15-compatibility-readiness"},{"title":"Following system colour scheme Selected dark colour scheme Selected light colour scheme","url":"https://peps.python.org/0790"},{"title":"python 3150 rc2","url":"https://blog.python.org/2026/09/python-3150-rc2/"},{"title":"Python 3.15 · Version Status","url":"https://endoflife.ai/python/3.15"}]},"The Python 3.15.0 final release is dated **October 9, 2026**, according to the python.org release page, which describes it as the stable release. Python 3.15.0 is the newest major release of the Python programming language, with 5,643 commits from 1,012 contributors.\n\nThe date moved from the original plan. PEP 790 had set the final for October 1, 2026. The team then issued a surprise third release candidate, 3.15.0rc3, on October 2, to address last-minute lazy-import blockers, which pushed the final release back a week. The rc3 announcement scheduled 3.15.0 final for 2026-10-09.\n\nEndoflife.ai also lists October 9, 2026 as the release date, with end of support on October 31, 2031."],"durationSeconds":4.4462910220000005,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015WadThHDrxVJfUZpBHbw8Z","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg72wxv15LteE4WBPDCWE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, Python 3.15 is out. The final 3.15.0 release came on **October 9, 2026**.\n\nThe original plan in PEP 790 was October 1. The team issued an unplanned third release candidate (3.15.0rc3) on October 2 to fix last-minute blockers in the lazy-imports feature, and that pushed the final release back a week. One source lists end of support as October 31, 2031.\n\nThese details come from one search. I read the search summaries and didn't open the pages myself.\n\nSources:\n- [Python 3.15.0 release page](https://python.org/downloads/release/python-3150/)\n- [Python 3.15.0rc3](https://www.python.org/downloads/release/python-3150rc3/)\n- [PEP 790](https://peps.python.org/pep-0790/)\n- [Python 3.15 version status (endoflife.ai)](https://endoflife.ai/python/3.15)\n- [Real Python news, October 2026](https://realpython.com/python-news-october-2026/)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":862,"cache_read_input_tokens":18639,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":862},"output_tokens":330,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3c044aab-651c-4ab7-8e3f-da385a2436a5","uuid":"23180067-a665-4526-9922-7533b8f7084c","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:39:02.212Z","request_id":"req_011Cg72wxhMZ97KFPk4YYhLJ"}
